     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I used the R package shinythemes to custom my shiny APP. On local computer, everything is just fine. And this the screenshot of my APP on local computer.<div><br></div><div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-yTZmsDisj_g/WaA4aVaSkoI/AAAAAAAAAUo/R72kLwgGbHQZT9cZRBeqyuWOGZ0jpETdgCLcBGAs/s1600/t1.jpg\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-yTZmsDisj_g/WaA4aVaSkoI/AAAAAAAAAUo/R72kLwgGbHQZT9cZRBeqyuWOGZ0jpETdgCLcBGAs/s1600/t1.jpg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792388805950000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0UyxINVFUTatm_g9zB5kZ2\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-yTZmsDisj_g/WaA4aVaSkoI/AAAAAAAAAUo/R72kLwgGbHQZT9cZRBeqyuWOGZ0jpETdgCLcBGAs/s1600/t1.jpg\" border=\"0\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">Then I deployed this APP on a Linux server. It works fine except that the appearance of the shiny APP is different from that on local computer. And it looked weird. Here is the screenshot of the APP in web browser.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/--Oenlm-zcFc/WaA5ev9FjCI/AAAAAAAAAUw/vZvktKC30eAb-lAY0ALRMBN7uVvPQi5ZgCLcBGAs/s1600/t2.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/--Oenlm-zcFc/WaA5ev9FjCI/AAAAAAAAAUw/vZvktKC30eAb-lAY0ALRMBN7uVvPQi5ZgCLcBGAs/s1600/t2.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792388805950000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2S0CFC64FyrFIw0b5t3dFt\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/--Oenlm-zcFc/WaA5ev9FjCI/AAAAAAAAAUw/vZvktKC30eAb-lAY0ALRMBN7uVvPQi5ZgCLcBGAs/s1600/t2.png\" border=\"0\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">I&#39;m using R 3.4.1, shiny 1.0.5, shinythemes 1.1.1 on both local computer and the Linux server. </p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">The version of shiny-server is v1.5.3.838.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">Any help?</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">Thanks in advance!</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><div>\r\n<img></div></div></div>"
    ]
